 We are regularly looking for new colleagues May 01, 2023 
Koekela is regularly looking for enthusiastic, flexible all-round employees with coffee, catering and shopping experience for our store in The Hague, on Laan van Nieuw Oost-Indië. 
We offer: 
- positions for at least 8-24 hours per week; 
- a whole new, challenging working environment; 
- salary in accordance with the Horeca Collective Labor Agreement. 
Job requirements : 
-Flexibility, available on all days (Monday to Sunday) 
These can also be half days; 
-Barista experience; 
-Catering experience; 
-Shopping experience; 
-Affinity with our products; 
-You can be deployed anywhere: in the store, with coffee, in the service and when doing the dishes. 
Competencies : 
- good command of the Dutch and English language; 
- customer and guest orientation; 
- stress resistance; 
- energetic. 
Do you have the above-mentioned competencies and would you like to take on this new challenge with us? 
Please email your motivation and CV to pz@koekela.nl 
Kind regards, Cookie Bakers, 
Manon Gijtenbeek 
